---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import games from '../data/games.json';
import apps from '../data/apps.json';
import {genreDetails, slugify} from '../data/genres.mjs';
const playable = games.filter(game => game.play);
---
<Base title="Kata Arcade & Tool Shed" description="Explore intrepion’s browser games in the Kata Arcade and useful little apps in the Kata Tool Shed." section="home">
<section class="portal-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT EXPERIMENTS / BY INTREPION</p><h1>A little curiosity.<br /><em>Two places to go.</em></h1><p>Some ideas are made for playing.<br class="desktop-break" /> Others are made for making. Follow yours.</p></section>
<section class="portal-doors wrap" aria-label="Choose a collection">
<a class="portal-door arcade-door" href="/arcade/"><div class="door-top"><span class="eyebrow">01 / PLAY SOMETHING</span><span class="door-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="door-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="play-asterisk">✳</span><span class="play-orbit">◈</span><span class="art-label">INSERT CURIOSITY</span></div><div class="door-copy"><h2>Kata Arcade</h2><p>Little worlds. Clever puzzles. One more go.</p><span class="door-action">Explore {playable.length} browser games <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a>
<a class="portal-door tool-door" href="/tools/"><div class="door-top"><span class="eyebrow">02 / MAKE SOMETHING</span><span class="door-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="door-art tool-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="pegboard"></div><span class="tool-knob"></span><span class="tool-sliders"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="art-label">IDEAS, PUT TO WORK</span></div><div class="door-copy"><h2>Kata Tool Shed</h2><p>Useful little apps. Room to tinker.</p><span class="door-action">Explore {apps.length === 1 ? 'the first app' : `${apps.length} apps`} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a>
</section>
<section class="portal-about wrap" id="about"><p class="eyebrow">SMALL EXERCISES, OPEN POSSIBILITIES</p><h2>Practice makes <em>interesting.</em></h2><p>I’m Oliver, also known as intrepion. A kata is a small exercise. These are mine: independent games and apps, built to learn by doing. Different tools, different approaches, and plenty of curiosity.</p></section>
<section class="legacy-genres wrap" id="genres" aria-labelledby="legacy-genres-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOOKING FOR THE GAMES?</p><h2 id="legacy-genres-title">The arcade is right this way.</h2><a href="/arcade/" class="text-link">Browse the full Kata Arcade →</a></div><div class="genre-shortcuts" aria-label="Game genres">{Object.keys(genreDetails).map(genre => <a href={`/genres/${slugify(genre)}/`}>{genre} ↗</a>)}</div></section>
</Base>
